Scope

This licence covers the source code (app/, tools/, packaging/) and the
project's own original written and procedural content: the lessons, clinical
correlations and radiology case texts (data/content/lessons*.json,
clinical*.json, radiology*.json), the hand-written descriptions
(data/content/descriptions_extra*.json), the Sketchfab part names and notes
(data/content/sketchfab_parts/), the Sketchfab catalogue summaries
(data/content/sketchfab.json), the microanatomy models (generated by the code in
app/micro/, cached in data/micro_cache) and the application icon.

It does NOT cover third-party material shipped alongside, which keeps its own
licence: the anatomy dataset in data/anatomy and data/findings (CC BY-SA 4.0,
see data/anatomy/LICENSE), the histology and radiology images (each under the
licence recorded beside it), the downloaded Sketchfab models in
data/sketchfab_models (each under its creator's Creative Commons licence, some
of them NonCommercial / NoDerivatives), and the bundled libraries. See
THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md for the full list.

Anatomy Explorer is a study aid. It is not a medical device and must not be used
for diagnosis or treatment.
